## <span style="color:#f2b84b;font-weight:800">Live</span> input

::: input data "Numbers to sort" default="34, 2, 53, 12, 4, 6" run=live

Sorting <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:#7fd6a4">[{{data}}]</span>. Edit the box, press Enter.

```java run id=live
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] a = {{{data}}};
        Trace.state("start", a, 1, Trace.NONE);
        for (int i = 1; i < a.length; i++) {
            int key = a[i], j = i - 1;
            Trace.state("pick", a, i, key, i);
            while (j >= 0) {
                Trace.state("compare", a, i, key, j);
                if (a[j] <= key) break;
                a[j + 1] = a[j];
                j--;
                Trace.state("shift", a, i, key, j + 1);
            }
            a[j + 1] = key;
            Trace.state("insert", a, i + 1, Trace.NONE, j + 1);
        }
        Trace.state("done", a, a.length, Trace.NONE);
    }
}
```

