## Buttons swap the code

```java run id=demo
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) { System.out.println("Hello from Java"); }
}
```

```python def=py_hello
print("Hello from Python")
```

```java def=java_hello
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) { System.out.println("Hello from Java"); }
}
```

::: button "Java version"
set demo = java_hello as java
:::

::: button "Python version, and run it"
set demo = py_hello as python
run demo
:::

